# Figentra Flow (@figentra-oss/flow, MIT) resolves from the Figentra registry's open scope, read anonymously
# (ADR 0503). From 0.3.0 its CLI depends on @stackra/console and @stackra/validation, which a dependency resolves
# from the same Stackra registry, also read anonymously. Every other dependency comes from npmjs.
@figentra-oss:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
@stackra:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
